@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy policy"; }
<div class="container-xl" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="page-head"><div class="kicker">Legal</div><h1>Privacy policy</h1></div>
    <p>VCT Hub is a non-commercial student project (Taras Shevchenko National University of Kyiv, course “Web technologies”).</p>
    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">What we store</h2>
    <p>If you create an account we store your name, email address and, when you sign in with Google, your Google account id and profile picture URL. Workspaces keep the strategy documents and boards their members create.</p>
    <p>If you follow a team through our Telegram bot we store your Telegram chat id and the teams you follow.</p>
    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">What we don't do</h2>
    <p>We don't sell or share personal data, and we don't send marketing email. Google sign-in only asks for your basic profile and email.</p>
    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Analytics</h2>
    <p>Anonymous page views and a few interface events (search, filters, shares) are counted with Google Analytics.</p>
    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Deleting your data</h2>
    <p>Write to the project author on GitHub (<a href="https://github.com/Alemek1075/VCT_tournament">Alemek1075/VCT_tournament</a>) and your account will be removed. In Telegram, /unfollow stops all messages.</p>
</div>
